Key layout: Android's keyboard_layout_russian.kcm (platform/frameworks/base, InputDevices), Apache License 2.0, with Kazakh's letters held on the Russian letters nearest them.

Words: A word list built by HeliBoard's aosp-dictionaries (main_kk__experimental.combined) from the Leipzig Corpora Collection (https://wortschatz.uni-leipzig.de/en/download), CC BY 4.0. D. Goldhahn, T. Eckart and U. Quasthoff: Building Large Monolingual Dictionaries at the Leipzig Corpora Collection: From 100 to 200 Languages. LREC 2012.

Ranked by how often each word appears in the Leipzig Corpora Collection's kaz_newscrawl_2016_1M (https://wortschatz.uni-leipzig.de/en/download), CC BY 4.0, and only the words it uses kept. D. Goldhahn, T. Eckart and U. Quasthoff: Building Large Monolingual Dictionaries at the Leipzig Corpora Collection: From 100 to 200 Languages. LREC 2012.

Next words (pairs.bin): counts of word pairs from the Leipzig Corpora Collection's kaz_newscrawl_2016_1M (https://wortschatz.uni-leipzig.de/en/download), CC BY 4.0. D. Goldhahn, T. Eckart and U. Quasthoff: Building Large Monolingual Dictionaries at the Leipzig Corpora Collection: From 100 to 200 Languages. LREC 2012. Built by tools/im/next_words.py; only the counts of the most common word pairs are included.

Starters: the words that most often begin a sentence in the Leipzig Corpora Collection's kaz_newscrawl_2016_1M (https://wortschatz.uni-leipzig.de/en/download), CC BY 4.0.
